45 653.0 Td (## Q1 ? Sorting Under Different Data Conditions \(6 Marks\)) Tj
45 641.0 Td () Tj
45 629.0 Td (### Algorithm Design) Tj
45 617.0 Td () Tj
45 605.0 Td (Three sorting algorithms were implemented with explicit comparison counting:) Tj
45 593.0 Td () Tj
45 581.0 Td (**Selection Sort** ? Always scans entire unsorted portion to find minimum. No early termination. Comparis) Tj
45 569.0 Td () Tj
45 557.0 Td (**Bubble Sort** ? Swaps adjacent out-of-order elements. With early termination optimisation: stops immedi) Tj
45 545.0 Td () Tj
45 533.0 Td (**Insertion Sort** ? Inserts each element into its correct position in the sorted prefix. Naturally adapt) Tj
45 521.0 Td () Tj
45 509.0 Td (### Mathematical Derivation) Tj
45 497.0 Td () Tj
45 485.0 Td (```) Tj
45 473.0 Td (Selection Sort:  C\(n\) = ?\(i=0 to n-2\)\(n-1-i\) = n\(n-1\)/2) Tj
45 461.0 Td (Bubble Sort worst: C\(n\) = n\(n-1\)/2  \(same sum, reverse sorted\)) Tj
45 449.0 Td (Insertion Sort worst: C\(n\) = ?\(i=1 to n-1\) i = n\(n-1\)/2) Tj
45 437.0 Td () Tj
45 425.0 Td (For n=1000: n\(n-1\)/2 = 499,500 \(all confirmed experimentally\)) Tj
45 413.0 Td (```) Tj
45 401.0 Td () Tj
45 389.0 Td (### Experimental Results ? Comparison Counts) Tj
45 377.0 Td () Tj
45 365.0 Td (| n    | Condition     | Selection | Bubble   | Insertion |) Tj
45 353.0 Td (|------|--------------|-----------|----------|-----------|) Tj
45 341.0 Td (| 1000 | Random       | 499,500   | 498,713  | 245,031   |) Tj
45 329.0 Td (| 1000 | Sorted       | 499,500   | 999      | 999       |) Tj
45 317.0 Td (| 1000 | Reverse      | 499,500   | 499,500  | 499,500   |) Tj
45 305.0 Td (| 1000 | Nearly Sorted| 499,500   | 492,594  | 56,360    |) Tj
45 293.0 Td () Tj
45 281.0 Td (### Complexity Analysis) Tj
45 269.0 Td () Tj
45 257.0 Td (| Algorithm      | Best   | Average | Worst  | Stable | Adaptive |) Tj
45 245.0 Td (|----------------|--------|---------|--------|--------|----------|) Tj
45 233.0 Td (| Selection Sort | O\(n²\)  | O\(n²\)   | O\(n²\)  | No     | No       |) Tj
45 221.0 Td (| Bubble Sort    | O\(n\)   | O\(n²\)   | O\(n²\)  | Yes    | Yes      |) Tj
45 209.0 Td (| Insertion Sort | O\(n\)   | O\(n²\)   | O\(n²\)  | Yes    | Yes      |) Tj
45 197.0 Td () Tj
45 185.0 Td (### Observations) Tj
45 173.0 Td (1. Selection Sort: Exactly 499,500 comparisons for ALL conditions ? truly not adaptive.) Tj
45 161.0 Td (2. Bubble Sort: 999 comparisons for already-sorted input \(early termination works\).) Tj
45 149.0 Td (3. Insertion Sort: Only 56,360 comparisons for nearly-sorted n=1000 \(vs 499,500 worst\).) Tj
45 137.0 Td (4. For nearly-sorted data, Insertion Sort uses **8.9×** fewer comparisons than Bubble Sort.) Tj
45 125.0 Td () Tj
45 113.0 Td (### Recommendation) Tj
45 101.0 Td (**Use Insertion Sort** for the emergency dispatch priority system.) Tj
45 89.0 Td (- Emergency data arrives incrementally ? nearly-sorted characteristic.) Tj
45 77.0 Td (- Insertion Sort achieves O\(n\) performance for nearly-sorted input.) Tj
45 65.0 Td (- It is STABLE \(equal priorities preserve original order\) and ADAPTIVE.) Tj
45 53.0 Td (- For n > 10,000: upgrade to Timsort or Merge Sort \(O\(n log n\)\).) Tj
ET
endstream
