45 209.0 Td (## Q7 ? Day-4 Design Challenge: Diagnose, Redesign, Validate \(13 Marks\)) Tj
45 197.0 Td () Tj
45 185.0 Td (### A. Diagnose the Bottleneck \(2 marks\)) Tj
45 173.0 Td (- **Most effort:** 2? outer loop × n inner bit-checks = n×2? operations total.) Tj
45 161.0 Td (- **Growth:** Each additional package doubles all work \(confirmed: n=20?n=25 is 32×\).) Tj
45 149.0 Td (- **Repeated work:** Subset prefix {P1,P2} re-computed for 2^\(n-2\) subsets.) Tj
45 137.0 Td (- **Root cause:** Blind enumeration with no pruning or memory across iterations.) Tj
45 125.0 Td () Tj
45 113.0 Td (### B. Design Objective \(2 marks\)) Tj
45 101.0 Td (1. Prune branches when partial weight already exceeds W.) Tj
45 89.0 Td (2. Prune branches when best possible future value ? current best.) Tj
45 77.0 Td (3. Reuse partial sums along recursion path.) Tj
45 65.0 Td (4. **Measurable target:** nodes_explored << 2?, gap growing with n.) Tj
45 53.0 Td () Tj
ET
