45 785.0 Td (### C. Redesigned Strategy \(4 marks\)) Tj
45 773.0 Td (**Branch-and-Bound with Greedy Fractional Upper Bound:**) Tj
45 761.0 Td () Tj
45 749.0 Td (Sort packages by value/weight ratio descending \(preprocessing: O\(n log n\)\).  ) Tj
45 737.0 Td (Explore items one-by-one \(include/exclude decision tree\).  ) Tj
45 725.0 Td (At each node, compute greedy upper bound using fractional knapsack.  ) Tj
45 713.0 Td (If upper bound ? current best ? prune entire branch.) Tj
45 701.0 Td () Tj
45 689.0 Td (**What is exploited:**) Tj
45 677.0 Td (- Capacity constraint: makes infeasible branches prunable immediately.) Tj
45 665.0 Td (- Greedy bound: provides tight upper bound on best achievable value in subtree.) Tj
45 653.0 Td (- Sorted order: maximises early pruning effectiveness.) Tj
45 641.0 Td () Tj
45 629.0 Td (### D. Prediction \(1 mark\)) Tj
45 617.0 Td (> B&B will explore significantly fewer than 2? nodes, with the gap widening as n grows.  ) Tj
45 605.0 Td (> At n=20: exhaustive = 1,048,576; B&B predicted ~10,000?100,000 \(10?100× faster\).  ) Tj
45 593.0 Td (> Performance measure: `nodes_explored` \(directly comparable\).) Tj
